Todo app with a twist

Native app (not web-page)

Platform:
- first MacOS
- potentially Windows
- potentially Mobiles

Good to have common core to possibly share between platforms int he future

Workflow:

Always on top rectangular area, consistms of two areas
Area 1:
- can tap/click to start typing todo note
- can drag-n-drop anything in the area

Area 2:
Todo items for today, shows as a list of short description. Click on each of them will show full item in-place (animated fold/unfold)
Area 2 should be hidden while screen sharing is on.

——————

- When new item added (via text or drag-n-drop) — add it to the Area2 in the end of the list
- Each item can be moved to the "Libmo" (temporary "folder" for everything non-today) — fast action
- Each item can be moved to the "Tomorrow" — fast action
- Each item can be marked as "Done" and move to Done folder
- At the end of the day — everything left from today moves to tomorrow 
- Next day should start from the everything from "tomorrow list"
- Folders can be accepted throung the status bar app icon


